The '''New Year's Eve Party Ball''' is a [[wikipedia:Time ball#Times Square|time ball]]. The balls could be found at: The [[Pixiewood Hills|downtown]] in [[Sanctuary]], [[Greenwood Forest]] [[Warpstones|Warpstone]], [[Snowhill]] outside the [[Mayor Crystalline|mayor]]'s house, and [[Shrouded Glade]] near the top of the steps.

