==Trivia==
*The balls were introduced in-game on December 20, 2013 as a part of the [[New Year's Eve]] [[Events|event]].
*The New Year's Eve Party Balls were inspired by the [[wikipedia:Times Square Ball|Times Square Ball]] in [[wikipedia:New York City|New York City]]. 
*On December 31, 2013, the New Year's Eve Party Balls dropped in celebration of the [[wikipedia:New Year's Day|new year]], 2014.
